<!-- =========================================================
     INTRODUCTION
========================================================= -->

<section class="py-5">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">


            <div class="col-lg-6">

                <span class="section-kicker">
                    WHO WE ARE
                </span>

                <h2 class="section-heading">
                    A platform for connection,
                    development and opportunity.
                </h2>


                <p class="text-secondary">

                    The Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Gems & Jewelry Association (KPGJA) is a representative organization
dedicated to the development, promotion, and strengthening of the gems and jewelry sector in
Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan.

                </p>


                <p class="text-secondary">

                  The Association works to bring together gemstone traders, jewelry businesses, lapidaries, artisans,
miners, exporters, e-commerce professionals, and other stakeholders connected with the gems and
jewelry industry.

                </p>


                <p class="text-secondary">

                    KPGJA aims to promote skill development, employment, value addition, digital transformation,
e-commerce, women’s participation, responsible business practices, and international market
access for the sector.

                </p>
                        <p class="text-secondary">

                  The Association also seeks to create stronger connections between local businesses and national
and international markets, while highlighting the rich gemstone resources and craftsmanship of
Khyber Pakhtunkhwa.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="col-lg-6">

                <div class="intro-image-wrapper">

                    <img src="/assets/img/about-home.jpg"
                         alt="Gems and jewellery professionals"
                         class="img-fluid">

                    <div class="intro-badge">

                        <i class="bi bi-gem"></i>

                        <span>

                            Gems & Jewellery

                            <small>
                                Khyber Pakhtunkhwa
                            </small>

                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     VISION & MISSION
========================================================= -->

<section class="objectives-section py-5">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="text-center mb-5">

            <span class="section-kicker">
                OUR DIRECTION
            </span>

            <h2 class="section-heading">
                Vision & Mission
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="row g-4">


            <!-- Vision -->

            <div class="col-lg-6">

                <div class="objective-card h-100">

                    <div class="objective-icon">

                        <i class="bi bi-eye"></i>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Our Vision
                    </h3>

                    <p>

                     To build a strong, skilled, transparent, and internationally connected gems and jewelry sector in
Khyber Pakhtunkhwa that creates employment, supports entrepreneurship, promotes value addition,
and contributes to sustainable economic development.

                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- Mission -->

            <div class="col-lg-6">

                <div class="objective-card h-100">

                    <div class="objective-icon">

                        <i class="bi bi-bullseye"></i>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Our Mission
                    </h3>

                    <ul class="mission-list"> <li>Promote the gems and jewellery sector of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa.</li> <li>Support gemstone traders, jewellery businesses, artisans, and other industry stakeholders.</li> <li>Encourage modern cutting, polishing, grading, finishing, and value-addition practices.</li> <li>Promote e-commerce and digital business opportunities.</li> <li>Facilitate access to national and international markets.</li> <li>Support skills development, training, and employment opportunities.</li> <li>Encourage greater participation of women and youth in the sector.</li> <li>Represent the interests of the gems and jewellery community before relevant institutions and organizations.</li> <li>Promote cooperation, transparency, professionalism, and long-term business relationships.</li> </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


